 "_comment": [
  "PROVISIONAL REFERENCE RATES \u2014 NOT AN AUTHORITY.",
  "Rule 115 requires the SBI telegraphic transfer buying rate as on the last",
  "day of the month immediately preceding the month of the transaction. Every",
  "rate here is a starting point so the application can compute something",
  "straight away; each is flagged provisional and the interface tells you which",
  "months you actually relied on. Replace them with the published SBI figures",
  "before you file, either by editing this file or by entering the rate on the",
  "Foreign income page, which always wins over anything here.",
  "The key it is filed under is the month the rate is QUOTED for, so a vest in",
  "September 2025 reads the 2025-08 entry."
 ],
